#EXTM3U
# ===============================================================
#  Indonesia FTA TV — Playlist preset PC-TV
#  Sumber: situs/stream resmi masing-masing stasiun.
#  Channel TVRI/Metro/Magna/RTV: tanpa header khusus.
#  Channel MNC (RCTI/MNCTV/GTV/iNews): butuh Referer rctiplus.
#  Ketersediaan Transmedia bergantung endpoint dan jaringan; geoblocking belum dipastikan.
# ===============================================================

#EXTINF:-1 tvg-id="TVRI.id" group-title="TVRI",TVRI Nasional
